Terminais sem uso na gramática

    '%'


Gramática

    0 $accept: ProgL $end

    1 ProgL: Prog

    2 Prog: Prog Function
    3     | Function

    4 Function: TypeF ID '(' ParamList ')' '{' Decls Statement_Seq '}'
    5         | TypeF ID '(' ')' '{' Decls Statement_Seq '}'

    6 FunctionCall: ID '(' ArgList ')'
    7             | ID '(' ')'

    8 ArgList: Exp ',' ArgList
    9        | Exp

   10 ParamList: ParamList ',' Type ID
   11          | Type ID

   12 Decls: Decl ';' Decls
   13      | ε

   14 Decl: Type IDs

   15 IDs: IDs ',' ID
   16    | IDs ',' Atribuicao
   17    | IDs ',' ID '[' NUM ']'
   18    | ID '[' NUM ']'
   19    | ID
   20    | Atribuicao

   21 TypeF: VOID
   22      | Type

   23 Type: INT
   24     | CHAR
   25     | FLOAT

   26 Statement_Seq: Statement Statement_Seq
   27              | Statement

   28 Statement: Atribuicao ';'
   29          | If
   30          | For
   31          | While
   32          | DoWhile
   33          | FunctionCall ';'
   34          | RETURN ID ';'
   35          | RETURN NUM ';'
   36          | RETURN ';'

   37 Compound_Stt: Statement
   38             | '{' Statement_Seq '}'

   39 If: IF '(' Exp ')' Compound_Stt ENDIF
   40   | IF '(' Exp ')' Compound_Stt ELSE Compound_Stt ENDIF

   41 While: WHILE '(' Exp ')' Compound_Stt

   42 For: FOR '(' Atribuicao ',' Exp ',' Exp ')' Compound_Stt

   43 DoWhile: DO Compound_Stt WHILE '(' Exp ')' ';'

   44 Atribuicao: ID '[' NUM ']' '=' Exp
   45           | ID '=' Exp

   46 Exp: Exp '+' Exp
   47    | Exp '-' Exp
   48    | Exp '*' Exp
   49    | Exp '/' Exp
   50    | Exp '>' Exp
   51    | Exp '<' Exp
   52    | Exp GE Exp
   53    | Exp LE Exp
   54    | Exp EQ Exp
   55    | Exp NEQ Exp
   56    | Exp OR Exp
   57    | Exp AND Exp
   58    | NOT Exp
   59    | '(' Exp ')'
   60    | NUM
   61    | NUM_REAL
   62    | ID '[' Exp ']'
   63    | ID
   64    | CHARACTERE
   65    | FunctionCall
   66    | STRING


